; BOOTUP.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; BDATA: tables, strings and the roster/party buffers (0100-1209).
;
; Overview: the data of the menu program. Before 0100, labels for the PSP: the FCB at 005C and
; the bytes 00FA-00FF where the chain load of EXODUS.BIN plants its code. Then the space of
; the library's tables (CombatPlayer-CombatPartyTile), the disk check's result (DiskCheckResult), PartyBuf (PARTY.ULT:
; header and four records), Roster (ROSTER.ULT), DemoTiles, MovesCells/MovesValues and
; DemoStep (the title picture), the file names and all the strings, with the name tables
; (StatusNames, WeaponNames, ArmourNames, SexNames, RaceNames, ClassNames) and the menus
; (MainMenu, OrganizeMenu): each name table follows its strings and, where letters are
; looked up, a string of the key letters in the same order. AskChoice (choose from a menu)
; takes such a key string (DI), its name table (SI) and the count (CX). Last, the int 24h
; handler (CritErrRetry).
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
EXTRN StartUp:NEAR
PUBLIC PspFcb
PUBLIC FcbCurBlock
PUBLIC FcbRecSize
PUBLIC FcbFileSize
PUBLIC FcbCurRec
